#: app/Lib/Integrations/WooCommerceSubscriptionsIntegration.php:605
msgid ""
"Subscription upgrades cannot be added to this cart with other items. This is "
"due to a compatibility issue with the Solid Affiliate plugin Recurring "
"Referrals feature. To resolve this, please clear your cart and add only the "
"subscription upgrade. Alternatively, you can disable the Solid Affiliate - "
"Recurring Referrals setting or contact our support team at "
"team@solidaffiliate.com for further assistance."
msgstr ""
"订阅升级不能与其他项目一起添加到此购物车。这是由于 Solid Affiliate 插件的循环"
"推荐功能存在兼容性问题。要解决此问题，请清空您的购物车，只添加订购升级。或"
"者，您可禁用 Solid Affiliate - Recurring Referrals 设置，或联系我们的支持团"
"队 team@solidaffiliate.com 寻求进一步帮助。"

#: app/Lib/Integrations/WooCommerceSubscriptionsIntegration.php:614
msgid ""
"Subscription renewals cannot be added to this cart with other items. This is "
"due to a compatibility issue with the Solid Affiliate plugin Recurring "
"Referrals feature. To resolve this, please clear your cart and add only the "
"subscription renewal. Alternatively, you can disable the Solid Affiliate - "
"Recurring Referrals setting or contact our support team at "
"team@solidaffiliate.com for further assistance."
msgstr ""
"续订不能与其他项目一起添加到此购物车。这是由于 Solid Affiliate 插件的循环推荐"
"功能存在兼容性问题。要解决此问题，请清空您的购物车，仅添加续订。或者，您可禁"
"用 Solid Affiliate - Recurring Referrals 设置，或联系我们的支持团队 "
"team@solidaffiliate.com 寻求进一步帮助。"

