msgstr "网站管理员电子邮件"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:1115
msgid ""
"Enter one or more email addresses to receive Affiliate Manager "
"notifications. Separate multiple email addresses with a space in between."
msgstr ""
"输入一个或多个电子邮件地址来接收联盟经理的通知。多个电子邮件地址之间要用空格"
"隔开。"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:1148
msgid ""
"Enter the email to send when a new affiliate registers. HTML is accepted. "
"Available template tags:"
msgstr "输入新联盟注册时发送的电子邮件。可接受HTML。可用的模板标签："

