msgid ""
"<p>We are excited to inform you of the new referral program we now have on "
"our site. You can now earn cash or store credit by referring your friends to "
"our site through our affiliate program. You can do this simply by sharing "
"your unique affiliate link (found below) with your friends and family.</"
"p><p>There's nothing you need to do - everything is automatically tracked "
"and you'll receive an email whenever someone makes a purchase through your "
"link. You can also access <a href='{site_portal_url}'>your affiliate portal</"
"a> at any time to see who has clicked on your link or made a purchase.</"
"p><p>Your affiliate link: </span><strong>{default_affiliate_link}</"
"strong><br><span>Your coupon code: </"
"span><strong>{default_affiliate_coupon_code_or_note}</strong><br></p><p>We "
"appreciate your support and value your role in helping our company grow and "
"improve through word of mouth and recommendations. Thank you for being a "
"valued member of our community.</p><p><br></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>我们很高兴地通知你，我们的网站现在有一个新的推荐计划。你现在可以通过我们的"
"联盟计划将你的朋友推荐到我们的网站，从而赚取现金或商店信用。你可以通过与你的"
"朋友和家人分享你独特的联盟链接（见下文）来做到这一点。</p><p>你不需要做什么--"
"一切都被自动跟踪，只要有人通过你的链接购买，你就会收到一封邮件。你也可以在任"
"何时候访问<a href='{site_portal_url}'>你的联盟门户网站</a>，查看谁点击了你的"
"链接或进行了购买。</p><p>你的联盟链接。</"
"span><strong>{default_affiliate_link}</strong><br><span>你的优惠券代码。 </"
"span><strong>{default_affiliate_coupon_code_or_note}</strong><br></p><p>我们"
"感谢您的支持，并重视您通过口碑和推荐帮助我们公司成长和提高的作用。感谢你成为"
"我们社区有价值的成员。</p><p><br></p>"

